          <path d="M16 9v17M16 15l-5-3M16 20l5-3" stroke="#f6f1e3" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        Cropguard<span> - AI</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="how-it-works.html">How it works</a></li>
          <li><a href="scan.html">Scan a leaf</a></li>
          <li><a href="about.html">About us</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="login.html">Log in</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div>
          <h1>Catch crop disease before it spreads.</h1>
          <p>Take a photo of a leaf and Cropguard - AI tells you what is wrong and what to do about it, in seconds. Fewer lost plants, less spraying, a better harvest.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-solid" href="scan.html">Scan a leaf</a>
